message: "If you use this software, please cite the SplitAligner preprint below. A software DOI will be minted after the first tagged release."
title: "SplitAligner: Branch-Identity Coordinate System for Phylogenomics under Missing Taxa and Gene-Tree Discordance"
abstract: "Initial R reference implementation track for the SplitAligner branch-coordinate framework. This public seed release ships deterministic Catnip10 10-tip graph-oracle benchmark data, audit-ready accessors, and validation helpers for the primitive branch-coordinate ledger."
